  "body": "Here's your chance to secure a slice of the Orewa lifestyle at an attractive price! Positioned right in the heart of the town centre, just moments from Orewa Beach, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss.\r\n\r\nWith shops, cafés, restaurants and the beach all within easy walking distance, this location makes everyday living a breeze. Whether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer or savvy investor, this well-presented property offers an exciting opportunity to secure your place in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most sought-after seaside communities.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a sunny, fully fenced courtyard and the convenience of a secure ground-floor car park. Freshly repainted inside and out and with new carpeting, this property is ready for its next owners to move in and enjoy!\r\n\r\nInvestors, take note! With a rental appraisal of $750-775 per week, this property deserves your attention. Offering a low-maintenance lifestyle in a sought-after coastal location, it's an appealing addition to any investment portfolio.\r\n\r\nWith a CV of $790,000 and an asking price of just $689,000, this is an opportunity worth exploring. Our motivated vendors are keen to see a result and welcome all offers.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to make a move in Orewa! Contact Poppy Edgar today to arrange your viewing and discover the potential for yourself.",
